# APK output copies

After a Gradle build produces an APK under `composeApp/build/outputs/apk/`, copy each new APK into `/mnt/d/Users/jamus/Nextcloud/APKs`.

- Keep the original filename.
- Create the destination directory if it is missing.
- Do this for debug and release builds, including emulator installs.
- Copy only `.apk` files, not intermediate build outputs.

The package task already copies the APK. If a build is produced some other way, copy it before finishing.
